# Audio pipeline: derived artefacts that are regenerated, not reviewed.
# The manifest and the JSON/text reports are committed — the app consumes the
# manifest, and CI compares the reports. These two are not:
#   the cache is a local speed-up keyed by content hash and analysis version,
#   and the HTML report embeds file:// links into the licensed source tree,
#   which must never leave a developer's machine.
generated/audio/organic_audio_analysis_cache.json
generated/audio/organic_audio_report.html

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc
